functions.doc:
Yield dict nodes that (appear to) represent a label item.

Accepts mixed shapes:
  - {"label": "...", "items": [...], "key": "...", "tipcfg": {...}, ...}
  - {"label": "...", ...}
  - ["Label", [...]]  (pair-shape)

Returns (direct_map, nested_map) shaped exactly for FilterToolbar:
  direct_map: { "X": [[label, [items]], ...], ... }
  nested_map: { "A": {"B": [[label, [items]], ...], ...}, ... }
